// The application icon Explorer shows for telex.exe. The tray icons are still
// drawn with GDI at runtime (src/app/icon.cpp); this one has to be a file
// because the shell reads it without running the program.
//
// telex.ico is generated by macos/Tools/makeicon.swift from the same artwork,
// so both platforms show the same icon. Do not hand-edit it.
1 ICON "telex.ico"
